    {
      "id": "claim_295294e33b114bf9bee7f864b6fdbb33",
      "statement": "--threads is not validated at parse time in main(); it is passed through to sort_images, whose first operation enforces the bound 1 <= threads <= 100 and raises ValueError (\"threads must be between 1 and 100, got {threads}\") otherwise, before the output directory is created or any file is walked. test_cli_invalid_threads_value verifies subprocess runs with --threads 0 and --threads 101 both exit non-zero.",
