    {
      "id": "claim_c2ea2ed930e04ec4ba00edf8ffb44bf9",
      "statement": "setup_logging(level) configures logging via a single logging.basicConfig call with the format '%(asctime)s - [Thread %(thread)d] - %(levelname)s - %(message)s', which makes concurrent worker output attributable to individual threads; it is called once from main() after --log is resolved to a numeric level.",
