      "id": "claim_f6957f3a2fcd423e9133f837bd867e4d",
      "statement": "sort_images creates the output directory automatically (os.makedirs(output_path)) if it does not exist, before submitting any work; a nonexistent basepath yields an empty run because os.walk produces nothing.",
