    {
      "id": "claim_39c047832a914c75b5e83e9b74406c20",
      "statement": "CI is defined by .ci/ci.yaml pointing image.dockerfile at .ci/test.Dockerfile (python:3.12-slim with pip install --no-cache-dir Pillow exifread piexif, WORKDIR /workspace) and a single unit check whose cmd is the shell-less array [\"python\", \"-c\", \"import sortinfolder\"]. The unit job only imports the module and does not run pytest or the behavioral test file, so the gate is module importability.",
      "evidence": [
