    {
      "id": "claim_e6c25812be9948a39e0e5466deeeab68",
      "statement": "Copying precedes rotation and tagging, and there is no rollback: if a post-copy step fails, the already-copied destination remains, while the source file is counted as a failure and therefore contributes to the aggregate exit-status-1 rule.",
