      "id": "claim_9fcf1da76825492da16cd7593559cb3b",
      "statement": "shutil.copy2 preserves file metadata at the moment of copying, but the subsequent rotation and tagging edits act on the destination and can change file metadata, so the final output file is not guaranteed to retain every original timestamp.",
