      "id": "claim_c07d764148434771b3f13bb10215f258",
      "statement": "The output tree is additive with no overwrite and no content-based deduplication: an existing destination name is replaced by name_1.ext, name_2.ext, and so on, so re-running against an existing output creates numeric-suffixed copies rather than replacing earlier results.",
