      "id": "claim_19ee85902c0d4177afb17d7371c629a1",
      "statement": "An output path nested inside the source path is not detected or rejected, so a later scan can discover previously generated output files under the source tree and process them again; the source and output trees should be kept distinct and non-overlapping.",
